00:02:07.801 --> 00:02:09.601
♪ It was grace ♪

00:02:09.601 --> 00:02:12.534
♪ Stunned by the last lights
of the sun ♪

00:02:12.534 --> 00:02:16.367
♪ We were swimming in
a green sea as deep as a drum ♪

00:02:16.367 --> 00:02:19.434
♪ And there are things I must
record, must praise ♪

00:02:19.434 --> 00:02:22.601
♪ Things I have to say about
the fullness and the blaze ♪

00:02:22.601 --> 00:02:25.033
♪ Of this beautiful life ♪

00:02:25.033 --> 00:02:27.901
♪ The beloved watched
the world on its knees ♪

00:02:27.901 --> 00:02:30.067
♪ With an infinite degree
of separation ♪

00:02:30.067 --> 00:02:32.000
♪ That was something to see ♪

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.601
♪ And my friend told me ♪

00:02:33.601 --> 00:02:36.634
♪ Death is like taking off
a tight shoe ♪

00:02:36.634 --> 00:02:41.834
♪ And when I stopped looking for
me, I was able to find you ♪

00:02:41.834 --> 00:02:44.367
♪ Right there,
where everything is ♪

00:02:44.367 --> 00:02:45.701
♪ Transcendent ♪

00:02:45.701 --> 00:02:49.634
♪ I feel myself opening up,
getting closer ♪

00:02:49.634 --> 00:02:51.167
♪ No hope is enough ♪

00:02:51.167 --> 00:02:54.567
♪ I've stopped hoping,
I'm learning to trust ♪

00:02:54.567 --> 00:02:57.100
♪ I came to under
that red moon ♪

00:02:57.100 --> 00:03:00.267
♪ And I was completely crushed ♪

00:03:00.267 --> 00:03:01.934
