please unscrew me ♪

00:03:04.734 --> 00:03:06.601
♪ Please, loosen me up ♪

00:03:06.601 --> 00:03:08.601
♪ Please make music
with me ♪

00:03:08.601 --> 00:03:10.000
♪ Make everything stop ♪

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.400
♪ Make noise and make silence
with me ♪

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:18.400
♪ Make love, let me be love,
let me be loving ♪

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:23.267
♪ Let me give love, receive
love, and be nothing but love ♪

00:03:23.267 --> 00:03:27.234
♪ In love, and for love,
and with love ♪

00:03:27.234 --> 00:03:31.701
♪ In love, and for love,
and with love ♪

00:03:31.701 --> 00:03:36.200
♪ And love said, if you bring
forth what is within you ♪

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:39.501
♪ What you bring forth
will save you ♪

00:03:39.501 --> 00:03:43.434
♪ But if you do not bring forth
what is within you ♪

00:03:43.434 --> 00:03:46.200
♪ What you do not bring forth ♪

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:48.067
