00:03:48.067 --> 00:03:50.868
♪ So let me be love,
let me be loving ♪

00:03:50.868 --> 00:03:54.734
♪ Let me give love, receive
love, and be nothing but love ♪

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:59.734
